{%- comment -%}
  Viste tu mesa — editorial landing + interactive table-styling advisor
  (faithful port of https://cartuja.gropius.link/viste-tu-mesa.html +
  styles/viste-tu-mesa.css + scripts/viste-tu-mesa.js, v69/v70: tubelight
  guide, real-image layers lab, progressive-unlock wizard, editorial results).

  Page = 7 pieces: hero (microparallax) · guía por pasos (tube-nav tabs +
  photo panels) · laboratorio de capas (real webp layers over a wood table,
  individual/mantel as a mutually-exclusive `data-exclusive="textil"` pair,
  one `cuberteria` toggle driving both tenedor + cuchillo, plato+bajoplato
  stack merge, quick presets) · asesor visual (6 progressive steps, photo
  cascade preview from the formulario tree) · resultado (SCORE matrix ×
  COLLECTIONS → top-3 editorial cards + match count-up) · comprar por capas
  (3 tiered buy cards) · toast.

  Theme-integration adaptations vs the raw mockup:
   - Scoped under `.vt-page`; mockup class names kept. The mockup's own
     header / mega-menu / footer markup + CSS + JS are dropped — the theme
     header-group / footer-group provide those. The mockup's reveal-on-scroll
     JS is dropped too (assets/theme.js already observes `.reveal`).
   - Image paths resolved through the window.__VT_ASSETS map below (asset_url):
     `assets/viste-tu-mesa/lab|guide|formulario/*` → flattened `vt-lab-*` /
     `vt-guide-*` / `vt-form-*` files. Only the shipped formulario subset
     (01-espacio ×4, 02-ocasion 4×4, 03-base jardín ×16, 04-textil jardín ×16)
     is mapped; resolve() returns null for unshipped candidates (05-estilo /
     06-presencia and non-jardín 03/04) so the live onerror cascade skips
     straight to the closest shipped photo. Root ambients keep their original
     basenames y solo actúan de respaldo si la colección no tiene imagen.
   - COLLECTIONS collectionUrl/featuredUrl: mockup .html pages mapped onto
     theme routes (/collections/<handle>, PDP demo /products/plato-llano-202-rosa).
   - Real cart: `[data-add]` buttons with `data-items` POST /cart/add.js and
     open the theme cart drawer. The mockup's fake `Cesta (n)` counter is NOT
     reintroduced.
   - Resultado sobre catálogo real: COLLECTIONS solo guarda copy editorial;
     nombre/url/precios/fotos/variantes se inyectan desde window.__VT_COLLECTIONS
     (Liquid, lista `vt_recs`). El «Ajuste visual» sale de la puntuación, no es
     un número fijo por posición.
   - Reduced-motion: keyframe/transition off-switch, instant scrolling,
     no microparallax, match numbers set without count-up.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign hero_img = section.settings.hero_image
  assign hero_demo = section.settings.hero_demo_image | default: 'hero-viste-tu-mesa.webp'
  assign root_assets = 'mesa_bodegon_lujo_el_renacer.webp,mesa_aurora_editorial.webp,mesa_aurora_oaxaca.webp,mesa_ochavada_negro_vistas.webp,gifts_decor_arch.webp,ochavada_canasto_floral.jpg,scene-left-tableware.webp' | split: ','
  assign lab_names = 'bajoplato,base-textil,centro-bajo,cuberteria-plata,cuchillo-plata,hondo-bol,mantel-bordado,mesa-madera,plato-auxiliar,plato-bajoplato,plato-protagonista,servilleta-bordada,tenedor-plata' | split: ','
  assign guide_names = 'base,capas,centro,compartir,gesto' | split: ','
  assign form_spaces = 'luminoso,clasico,contemporaneo,jardin' | split: ','
  assign form_occasions = 'desayuno,aperitivo,comidaFormal,cenaEspecial' | split: ','
  assign form_bases = 'woodLight,woodDark,stone,graphite' | split: ','
  assign form_textiles = 'linenWhite,linenBeige,pattern,dark' | split: ','
  assign vt_recs = 'aurora-blanca,ochavada-blanca,bellavista,202-rosa,ceilan,viejo-molino,oaxaca,negro-vistas,negro-vistas-ash-blue,negro-vistas-ash-yellow,flor-de-lis-azul,flor-de-lis-rosa' | split: ','
-%}

<div class="vt-page" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}">
  <!-- ===================== 1 · HERO ===================== -->
  <section aria-label="Viste tu mesa con La Cartuja" class="vt-hero" id="heroVTM">
    <div class="vt-hero__media">
      {%- if hero_img != blank -%}
        {% render 'image-responsive', image: hero_img, alt: 'Mesa vestida con piezas de La Cartuja de Sevilla', sizes: '100vw', loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high' %}
      {%- else -%}
        <img src="{{ hero_demo | asset_url }}" alt="Mesa vestida con piezas de La Cartuja de Sevilla" width="2048" height="1529" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
    <div class="vt-hero__inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">La Cartuja de Sevilla · desde 1841</span>
      <h1 class="display">Viste tu mesa con <em>La Cartuja</em>.</h1>
      <p>Del mantel al último detalle: aprende a crear una mesa equilibrada y descubre qué vajillas encajan con tu ocasión, tu espacio y tu forma de recibir.</p>
      <div class="vt-hero__ctas">
        <a class="ghost-btn solid" data-scroll-to="#guide" href="#guide">Aprender paso a paso</a>
        <a class="ghost-btn" data-scroll-to="#wizard" href="#wizard">Encontrar mi vajilla ideal</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <span class="vt-hero__scroll">Desliza</span>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== 2 · GUÍA PASO A PASO ===================== -->
  <section class="vt-section vt-steps-section" id="guide">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">La mesa, por capas</span>
      <h2>Cinco gestos para una <em>mesa equilibrada</em></h2>
      <p>Una guía más visual para entender la composición antes de elegir. Cada paso marca una decisión concreta: base, capas, gesto, centro y piezas para compartir.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="guide-experience reveal" data-guide-experience>
      <div class="tube-nav" role="tablist" aria-label="Pasos para vestir la mesa">
        <button class="tube-item is-active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-guide="base"><span>01</span><b>La base</b></button>
        <button class="tube-item" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-guide="capas"><span>02</span><b>Las capas</b></button>
        <button class="tube-item" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-guide="gesto"><span>03</span><b>El gesto</b></button>
        <button class="tube-item" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-guide="centro"><span>04</span><b>El centro</b></button>
        <button class="tube-item" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-guide="compartir"><span>05</span><b>Compartir</b></button>
      </div>
      <div class="guide-showcase">
        <div class="guide-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="guide-image-panel is-active" data-guide-image="base"><img src="{{ 'vt-guide-base.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1500" height="996" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="guide-image-panel" data-guide-image="capas"><img src="{{ 'vt-guide-capas.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1800" height="1343" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="guide-image-panel" data-guide-image="gesto"><img src="{{ 'vt-guide-gesto.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="450" height="450" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="guide-image-panel" data-guide-image="centro"><img src="{{ 'vt-guide-centro.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1800" height="1343" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="guide-image-panel" data-guide-image="compartir"><img src="{{ 'vt-guide-compartir.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1800" height="1343" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="guide-media-label"><span>01</span><b>La base</b></div>
        </div>
        <div class="guide-copy-wrap">
          <article class="guide-panel is-active" data-guide-panel="base"><span>01</span><h3>La base</h3><p>Mantel claro, camino de mesa, individuales o mesa vista. La base decide la temperatura visual: lino para suavizar, madera para naturalidad, piedra para luz y grafito para carácter.</p></article>
          <article class="guide-panel" data-guide-panel="capas"><span>02</span><h3>Las capas</h3><p>Bajoplato, plato llano, plato de postre y hondo o bol según el menú. La clave es dejar respirar cada borde y no tapar completamente la pieza anterior.</p></article>
          <article class="guide-panel" data-guide-panel="gesto"><span>03</span><h3>El gesto</h3><p>La servilleta ordena la escena. Puede ir lateral, sobre el plato o ligeramente bajo una pieza: discreta, limpia y con intención.</p></article>
          <article class="guide-panel" data-guide-panel="centro"><span>04</span><h3>El centro</h3><p>Flores bajas, velas o piezas decorativas. Debe aportar atmósfera sin romper la conversación ni competir con la vajilla.</p></article>
          <article class="guide-panel" data-guide-panel="compartir"><span>05</span><h3>Compartir</h3><p>Fuentes, boles, salseras y piezas de servicio completan la mesa. Son las piezas que convierten una composición bonita en una mesa útil.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== 3 · LABORATORIO DE CAPAS ===================== -->
  <section aria-label="Laboratorio visual de capas" class="vt-section soft-bg hairline" id="lab">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Laboratorio visual</span>
      <h2>Una mesa se compone <em>capa a capa</em></h2>
      <p>Activa y desactiva cada elemento para entender cómo se construye una mesa. Empieza por la base y añade solo lo que tu menú necesita.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lab reveal">
      <div aria-hidden="true" class="lab-stage">
        <div class="lab-table"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-mesa-madera.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1500" height="1500" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="lab-layer lab-individual on"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-base-textil.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1600" height="1593" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="lab-layer lab-mantel"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-mantel-bordado.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1594" height="1600" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="lab-layer lab-tenedor on"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-tenedor-plata.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="231" height="1100" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="lab-layer lab-cuchillo on"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-cuchillo-plata.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="226" height="1100" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="lab-layer lab-bajoplato on"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-bajoplato.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1500" height="1500" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="lab-layer lab-stack"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-plato-bajoplato.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1500" height="1500" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="lab-layer lab-protagonista on"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-plato-protagonista.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1500" height="1500" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="lab-layer lab-bol"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-hondo-bol.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1500" height="1500" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="lab-layer lab-auxiliar"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-plato-auxiliar.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1500" height="1500" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="lab-layer lab-servilleta"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-servilleta-bordada.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="581" height="1200" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="lab-layer lab-centro"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-centro-bajo.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="300" height="300" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="lab-status"><span id="labCount">4 capas activas</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="lab-controls">
        <h3>Construye tu mesa</h3>
        <p>Activa o retira cada pieza libremente. La madera queda siempre debajo y la composición se actualiza con una transición suave.</p>
        <div class="lab-quick-actions" aria-label="Acciones rápidas del laboratorio">
          <button type="button" data-lab-preset="clean">Mesa limpia</button>
          <button type="button" data-lab-preset="full">Mesa completa</button>
        </div>
        <button aria-pressed="true" class="lab-toggle" data-exclusive="textil" data-layer="individual" type="button"><span class="lab-thumb"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-base-textil.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1600" height="1593" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="lab-toggle__label"><b>Individual redondo</b><small>Textura ligera bajo el servicio</small></span><span class="lab-switch"></span></button>
        <button aria-pressed="false" class="lab-toggle" data-exclusive="textil" data-layer="mantel" type="button"><span class="lab-thumb"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-mantel-bordado.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1594" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="lab-toggle__label"><b>Mantel bordado</b><small>Cubre la madera con lino y cenefa</small></span><span class="lab-switch"></span></button>
        <button aria-pressed="true" class="lab-toggle" data-layer="cuberteria" type="button"><span class="lab-thumb"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-cuberteria-plata.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="900" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="lab-toggle__label"><b>Cubertería de plata</b><small>Tenedor a la izquierda y cuchillo a la derecha</small></span><span class="lab-switch"></span></button>
        <button aria-pressed="true" class="lab-toggle" data-layer="bajoplato" type="button"><span class="lab-thumb"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-bajoplato.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1500" height="1500" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="lab-toggle__label"><b>Bajo plato</b><small>Marca el sitio y da profundidad</small></span><span class="lab-switch"></span></button>
        <button aria-pressed="true" class="lab-toggle" data-layer="protagonista" type="button"><span class="lab-thumb"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-plato-protagonista.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1500" height="1500" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="lab-toggle__label"><b>Plato protagonista</b><small>La pieza central de la composición</small></span><span class="lab-switch"></span></button>
        <button aria-pressed="false" class="lab-toggle" data-layer="bol" type="button"><span class="lab-thumb"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-hondo-bol.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1500" height="1500" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="lab-toggle__label"><b>Hondo o bol</b><small>Para sopas, cremas o ensaladas</small></span><span class="lab-switch"></span></button>
        <button aria-pressed="false" class="lab-toggle" data-layer="auxiliar" type="button"><span class="lab-thumb"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-plato-auxiliar.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1500" height="1500" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="lab-toggle__label"><b>Plato auxiliar</b><small>Postre, pan o apoyo lateral</small></span><span class="lab-switch"></span></button>
        <button aria-pressed="false" class="lab-toggle" data-layer="servilleta" type="button"><span class="lab-thumb"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-servilleta-bordada.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="581" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="lab-toggle__label"><b>Servilleta bordada</b><small>A la derecha de la cubertería</small></span><span class="lab-switch"></span></button>
        <button aria-pressed="false" class="lab-toggle" data-layer="centro" type="button"><span class="lab-thumb"><img src="{{ 'vt-lab-centro-bajo.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="300" height="300" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="lab-toggle__label"><b>Centro bajo</b><small>Flores bajas o pieza decorativa</small></span><span class="lab-switch"></span></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== 4 · WIZARD + 5 · PREVIEW ===================== -->
  <section aria-label="Asesor visual de mesa" class="vt-section" id="wizard">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Asesor visual</span>
      <h2>Encuentra tu <em>vajilla ideal</em></h2>
      <p>Primero elige el espacio, después la ocasión, la mesa y el textil. Mientras respondes, la escena toma forma hasta llegar a tres vajillas pensadas para ti.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="wizard reveal">
      <div class="wizard-grid wizard-grid--redesign">
        <!-- preview en vivo -->
        <aside aria-label="Vista previa de tu mesa" class="wz-preview wz-preview--redesign">
          <div class="wz-preview__top"><span class="eyebrow">Vista en directo</span><small id="wzMiniStatus" aria-live="polite">Sin respuestas todavía</small></div>
          <div class="wz-stage" id="wzStage">
            <img alt="Vista previa editorial de la mesa seleccionada" class="wz-photo" id="wzPhoto" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1328" height="1760" src="{{ 'vt-form-01-espacio-luminoso.webp' | asset_url }}">
            <div class="wz-photo-overlay" id="wzPhotoOverlay"></div>
            <div class="wz-caption" id="wzCaption"><b>Tu mesa</b> · responde para verla tomar forma</div>
          </div>
          <div class="wz-live-summary" id="wzLiveSummary" aria-live="polite"><span>Selecciona el espacio para empezar</span></div>
        </aside>
        <!-- panel de preguntas -->
        <div class="wz-builder">
          <div class="wz-builder__head"><span>Asesor visual</span><b id="wzStepStatus" aria-live="polite">Paso 1 de 6</b></div>
          <div aria-hidden="true" class="wz-progress" id="wzProgress"></div>
          <div class="wz-panel" id="wzPanel"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== 6 · RESULTADO ===================== -->
  <section aria-label="Tus vajillas recomendadas" class="vt-section soft-bg hairline reveal" hidden id="result">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Tu resultado</span>
      <h2>Tres vajillas para <em>tu mesa</em></h2>
      <p>Seleccionadas según tu espacio, tu ocasión y tu forma de recibir. Pulsa cada una para verla en tu mesa.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="result">
      <div class="result-tabs" id="resultTabs" role="tablist"></div>
      <div id="resultCards"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== 7 · COMPRA POR CAPAS ===================== -->
  {%- comment -%} Resolve the three layered packs into real multi-item cart payloads + live totals. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- capture base_pack -%}{%- render 'viste-pack', items_text: section.settings.pack_base_items -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture full_pack -%}{%- render 'viste-pack', items_text: section.settings.pack_full_items -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture host_pack -%}{%- render 'viste-pack', items_text: section.settings.pack_host_items -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign base_parts = base_pack | split: '~~' -%}
  {%- assign full_parts = full_pack | split: '~~' -%}
  {%- assign host_parts = host_pack | split: '~~' -%}
  {%- assign base_total = base_parts[0] | plus: 0 -%}
  {%- assign full_total = full_parts[0] | plus: 0 -%}
  {%- assign host_total = host_parts[0] | plus: 0 -%}

  {%- if section.settings.show_buy_layers -%}
  <section aria-label="Comprar por capas" class="vt-section" id="buy">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Comprar por capas</span>
      <h2>Empieza por la base, <em>crece con calma</em></h2>
      <p>No hace falta tenerlo todo a la vez. Compón tu mesa en el orden que tenga sentido para tu casa.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="layers-buy reveal">
      <article class="buy-card">
        <span class="buy-card__tier">Capa 01</span>
        <h3>Set base</h3>
        <span class="buy-card__price">{% if base_total > 0 %}{{ base_total | money }}{% else %}desde 148 €{% endif %}</span>
        <ul>
          <li>Platos llanos para 4</li>
          <li>Platos de postre para 4</li>
          <li>Lo esencial para empezar a recibir</li>
        </ul>
        <button class="ghost-btn" data-add="Set base"{% if base_total > 0 %} data-items='{{ base_parts[1] }}'{% endif %} type="button">Añadir el set base</button>
      </article>
      <article class="buy-card feature">
        <span class="buy-card__tier">Capa 02 · la más elegida</span>
        <h3>Mesa completa</h3>
        <span class="buy-card__price">{% if full_total > 0 %}{{ full_total | money }}{% else %}desde 296 €{% endif %}</span>
        <ul>
          <li>Todo el set base</li>
          <li>Boles y platos hondos</li>
          <li>Fuente y salsera para compartir</li>
        </ul>
        <button class="ghost-btn" data-add="Mesa completa"{% if full_total > 0 %} data-items='{{ full_parts[1] }}'{% endif %} type="button">Añadir la mesa completa</button>
      </article>
      <article class="buy-card">
        <span class="buy-card__tier">Capa 03</span>
        <h3>Anfitrión</h3>
        <span class="buy-card__price">{% if host_total > 0 %}{{ host_total | money }}{% else %}desde 420 €{% endif %}</span>
        <ul>
          <li>Todo lo de la mesa completa</li>
          <li>Sopera y bandejas de servicio</li>
          <li>Piezas decorativas y de centro</li>
        </ul>
        <button class="ghost-btn" data-add="Set anfitrión"{% if host_total > 0 %} data-items='{{ host_parts[1] }}'{% endif %} type="button">Añadir el set anfitrión</button>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div aria-live="polite" class="vt-toast" id="vtToast" role="status"></div>
</div>

<script>
  window.__VT_ASSETS = {
    {%- for f in root_assets -%}"{{ f }}":"{{ f | asset_url }}",{%- endfor -%}
    {%- for n in lab_names -%}
      {%- assign lab_asset = 'vt-lab-' | append: n | append: '.webp' -%}
      "viste-tu-mesa/lab/{{ n }}.webp":"{{ lab_asset | asset_url }}",
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- for n in guide_names -%}
      {%- assign guide_asset = 'vt-guide-' | append: n | append: '.webp' -%}
      "viste-tu-mesa/guide/guide-{{ n }}.webp":"{{ guide_asset | asset_url }}",
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- for s in form_spaces -%}
      {%- assign space_asset = 'vt-form-01-espacio-' | append: s | append: '.webp' -%}
      "viste-tu-mesa/formulario/01-espacio/{{ s }}.webp":"{{ space_asset | asset_url }}",
      {%- for o in form_occasions -%}
        {%- assign occ_asset = 'vt-form-02-ocasion-' | append: s | append: '-' | append: o | append: '.webp' -%}
        "viste-tu-mesa/formulario/02-ocasion/{{ s }}/{{ o }}.webp":"{{ occ_asset | asset_url }}",
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- for o in form_occasions -%}
      {%- for b in form_bases -%}
        {%- assign jbase_asset = 'vt-form-03-base-jardin-' | append: o | append: '-' | append: b | append: '.webp' -%}
        "viste-tu-mesa/formulario/03-base/jardin/{{ o }}/{{ b }}.webp":"{{ jbase_asset | asset_url }}",
      {%- endfor -%}
      {%- for t in form_textiles -%}
        {%- assign jtex_asset = 'vt-form-04-textil-jardin-' | append: o | append: '-' | append: t | append: '.webp' -%}
        "viste-tu-mesa/formulario/04-textil/jardin/{{ o }}/{{ t }}.webp":"{{ jtex_asset | asset_url }}",
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  };
  {%- comment -%}
    Catálogo real para el asesor: título, url, imagen y 3 piezas por colección.
    Una colección despublicada o vacía no se emite → el JS la saca del pool de
    candidatos, así ninguna tarjeta de resultado puede enlazar a un 404.
    `collections[handle].products` no consume el cupo de all_products (<20) que
    usan los packs de «Comprar por capas».
  {%- endcomment -%}
  window.__VT_COLLECTIONS = {
    {%- for h in vt_recs -%}
      {%- assign col = collections[h] -%}
      {%- if col.products.size > 0 -%}
        {%- comment -%} col.featured_image = imagen de colección, o la del primer producto. {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign cover = col.featured_image -%}
        {{ h | json }}: {
          "name": {{ col.title | json }},
          "url": {{ col.url | json }},
          "image": {{ cover | image_url: width: 1400 | json }},
          "products": [
            {%- for p in col.products limit: 3 -%}
              {
                "n": {{ p.title | json }},
                "p": {{ p.price | money | json }},
                "img": {{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 640 | json }},
                "url": {{ p.url | json }},
                "vid": {{ p.selected_or_first_available_variant.id | json }}
              },
            {%- endfor -%}
          ]
        },
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  };
</script>

{% stylesheet %}
/* Page tokens (mockup :root values the theme doesn't share; --content
   re-declared because this page uses a wider shell than the theme). */
.vt-page { --content: min(90vw, 1760px); --ivory: #F6F4EF; --paper-warm: rgba(168, 174, 186, .12); --stone: rgba(168, 174, 186, .20); }

/* Shell utilities re-scoped for mockup parity */
.vt-page .soft-bg { background: var(--ivory); }
.vt-page .ghost-btn { min-height: 46px; height: auto; border-width: .5px; background: transparent; color: var(--ink); }
.vt-page .ghost-btn:hover { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; }
.vt-page .ghost-btn.solid { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; }
.vt-page .ghost-btn.solid:hover { background: var(--ink-soft); }
.vt-page .section-head { text-align: center; margin: 0 auto 56px; max-width: 720px; padding: 0 24px; }
.vt-page .section-head .eyebrow { display: block; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.vt-page .section-head h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(28px, 2.8vw, 44px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.005em; margin: 0 0 16px; color: var(--ink); }
.vt-page .section-head h2 em { font-style: italic; }
.vt-page .section-head p { margin: 0 auto; font-weight: 300; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 580px; }
.vt-page .hairline { border-top: .5px solid var(--rule); }

/* Section scaffolding */
.vt-page .vt-section { padding: 120px 0; }
.vt-page .vt-section.compact { padding: 84px 0; }

/* ===================== 1 · HERO ===================== */
.vt-page .vt-hero { position: relative; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; overflow: hidden; background: #0F1A2E; }
.vt-page .vt-hero__media { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; }
.vt-page .vt-hero__media img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: saturate(.96); }
.vt-page .vt-hero__media:after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15, 26, 46, .30) 0%, rgba(15, 26, 46, .10) 38%, rgba(15, 26, 46, .66) 100%); }
.vt-page .vt-hero__inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; width: var(--content); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 0 12vh; color: #fff; }
.vt-page .vt-hero .eyebrow { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .78); }
.vt-page .vt-hero h1 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(46px, 7vw, 118px); line-height: 1; margin: 18px 0 22px; max-width: 13ch; letter-spacing: -.01em; text-wrap: balance; }
.vt-page .vt-hero h1 em { font-style: italic; }
.vt-page .vt-hero p { font-weight: 300; font-size: clamp(14px, 1.1vw, 17px); line-height: 1.75; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .9); max-width: 560px; margin: 0 0 38px; }
.vt-page .vt-hero__ctas { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; }
.vt-page .vt-hero .ghost-btn { border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .8); color: #fff; }
.vt-page .vt-hero .ghost-btn:hover { background: #fff; color: var(--ink); }
.vt-page .vt-hero .ghost-btn.solid { background: #fff; color: var(--ink); border-color: #fff; }
.vt-page .vt-hero .ghost-btn.solid:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .86); }
.vt-page .vt-hero__scroll { position: absolute; right: 4vw; bottom: 30px; z-index: 3; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .75); font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .28em; text-transform: uppercase; writing-mode: vertical-rl; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
.vt-page .vt-hero__scroll:before { content: ""; width: .5px; height: 46px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .6); }
.vt-page .vt-hero:not(.vt-hero--atelier) .vt-hero__inner { display: block; max-width: none; }

/* ===================== 3 · LABORATORIO DE CAPAS ===================== */
.vt-page .lab { width: var(--content); margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr; gap: min(6vw, 84px); align-items: center; }
.vt-page .lab-stage { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 1/1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 50%; isolation: isolate; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 44%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .76), rgba(246, 244, 239, .56) 62%, rgba(15, 26, 46, .045) 100%); box-shadow: 0 30px 100px rgba(15, 26, 46, .10); overflow: visible; transition: transform 460ms var(--ease), box-shadow 460ms var(--ease); }
.vt-page .lab-stage:before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 1.4%; border: .5px solid rgba(15, 26, 46, .12); border-radius: 50%; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: inset 520ms var(--ease), border-color 520ms var(--ease); }
.vt-page .lab-stage:after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: -4%; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid rgba(15, 26, 46, .055); border-top-color: rgba(15, 26, 46, .18); z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; opacity: .72; animation: lab-orbit 18s linear infinite; }
.vt-page .lab-stage.is-updating { transform: scale(1.006); box-shadow: 0 36px 112px rgba(15, 26, 46, .13); }
.vt-page .lab-stage.is-updating:before { inset: .6%; border-color: rgba(15, 26, 46, .20); }
.vt-page .lab-table { position: absolute; inset: -6%; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; z-index: 1; filter: drop-shadow(0 22px 45px rgba(15, 26, 46, .14)); transition: opacity 520ms var(--ease), transform 700ms var(--ease-long); }
.vt-page .lab-table img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transform: scale(1.04); }
.vt-page .lab-layer { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; z-index: 3; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(.82); opacity: 0; transition: opacity 520ms var(--ease), transform 720ms var(--ease-long), filter 520ms var(--ease); pointer-events: none; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; will-change: transform, opacity; }
.vt-page .lab-layer.on { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1); }
.vt-page .lab-layer img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; filter: drop-shadow(0 14px 24px rgba(15, 26, 46, .16)); transform-origin: center; }
.vt-page .lab-layer.just-toggled.on img { animation: lab-pop 620ms var(--ease-long); }
.vt-page .lab-individual { width: 91%; height: 91%; z-index: 2; }
.vt-page .lab-individual img { filter: drop-shadow(0 18px 34px rgba(15, 26, 46, .14)); }
.vt-page .lab-mantel { width: 112%; height: 112%; z-index: 2; }
.vt-page .lab-mantel img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; filter: drop-shadow(0 14px 28px rgba(15, 26, 46, .11)); }
.vt-page .lab-stage.has-mantel .lab-table { opacity: 0; transform: scale(.985); }
.vt-page .lab-tenedor { width: 10%; height: 57%; left: 20%; top: 55%; z-index: 4; }
.vt-page .lab-cuchillo { width: 10%; height: 58%; left: 79%; top: 55%; z-index: 4; }
.vt-page .lab-tenedor img, .vt-page .lab-cuchillo img { filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 15px rgba(15, 26, 46, .20)); }
.vt-page .lab-bajoplato { width: 78%; height: 78%; z-index: 4; }
.vt-page .lab-protagonista { width: 60%; height: 60%; z-index: 5; }
.vt-page .lab-stack { width: 78%; height: 78%; z-index: 5; }
.vt-page .lab-stack img { filter: drop-shadow(0 20px 34px rgba(15, 26, 46, .20)); }
.vt-page .lab-stage.has-stack .lab-bajoplato.on, .vt-page .lab-stage.has-stack .lab-protagonista.on { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(.96); }
.vt-page .lab-stage.has-stack .lab-stack { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1); }
.vt-page .lab-bol { width: 48%; height: 48%; left: 50%; top: 50%; z-index: 6; }
.vt-page .lab-bol.on { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1); }
.vt-page .lab-auxiliar { width: 44%; height: 44%; left: 76%; top: 17%; z-index: 7; }
.vt-page .lab-auxiliar.on { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(8deg) scale(1); }
.vt-page .lab-servilleta { width: 18%; height: 47%; left: 93%; top: 56%; z-index: 4; transform-origin: center; }
.vt-page .lab-servilleta.on { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(2deg) scale(1); }
.vt-page .lab-servilleta img { filter: drop-shadow(0 14px 20px rgba(15, 26, 46, .18)); transform: scale(1.08); }
.vt-page .lab-centro { width: 35%; height: 35%; left: 50%; top: 8%; z-index: 8; }
.vt-page .lab-centro.on { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1); }
.vt-page .lab-centro img { filter: drop-shadow(0 16px 30px rgba(15, 26, 46, .18)); }
.vt-page .lab-status { position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: -22px; transform: translateX(-50%); z-index: 12; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 150px; height: 38px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .88); border: .5px solid rgba(15, 26, 46, .12); box-shadow: 0 16px 38px rgba(15, 26, 46, .09); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink); }
.vt-page .lab-controls { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.vt-page .lab-controls h3 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(24px, 2.2vw, 34px); line-height: 1.12; margin: 0 0 8px; }
.vt-page .lab-controls > p { font-weight: 300; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0 0 12px; max-width: 48ch; }
.vt-page .lab-quick-actions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; margin: 2px 0 4px; }
.vt-page .lab-quick-actions button { min-height: 42px; border: .5px solid rgba(15, 26, 46, .14); border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .58); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink); transition: background 280ms var(--ease), border-color 280ms var(--ease), transform 280ms var(--ease), box-shadow 280ms var(--ease); }
.vt-page .lab-quick-actions button:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); background: #fff; border-color: rgba(15, 26, 46, .25); box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(15, 26, 46, .06); }
.vt-page .lab-toggle { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 58px 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 14px; width: 100%; min-height: 74px; padding: 10px 14px 10px 10px; border: .5px solid rgba(15, 26, 46, .12); border-radius: 999px; text-align: left; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .62); box-shadow: 0 12px 38px rgba(15, 26, 46, .035); overflow: hidden; transition: transform 280ms var(--ease), background 280ms var(--ease), border-color 280ms var(--ease), box-shadow 280ms var(--ease); }
.vt-page .lab-toggle:hover { transform: translateX(4px); background: #fff; border-color: rgba(15, 26, 46, .22); box-shadow: 0 16px 42px rgba(15, 26, 46, .065); }
.vt-page .lab-toggle[aria-pressed="true"] { background: #fff; border-color: rgba(15, 26, 46, .28); box-shadow: 0 16px 44px rgba(15, 26, 46, .08); }
.vt-page .lab-thumb { width: 54px; height: 54px; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: var(--ivory); border: .5px solid rgba(15, 26, 46, .10); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, .65); position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.vt-page .lab-thumb img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; transform: scale(1.18); }
.vt-page .lab-toggle[data-layer="servilleta"] .lab-thumb img { transform: scale(1.16); }
.vt-page .lab-toggle[data-layer="centro"] .lab-thumb img { transform: scale(1.25); }
.vt-page .lab-toggle[data-layer="individual"] .lab-thumb img { transform: scale(1.34); }
.vt-page .lab-toggle[data-layer="mantel"] .lab-thumb img { transform: scale(1.10); }
.vt-page .lab-toggle[data-layer="cuberteria"] .lab-thumb img { transform: scale(1.08); }
.vt-page .lab-toggle[data-layer="auxiliar"] .lab-thumb img { transform: scale(1.32) rotate(8deg); }
.vt-page .lab-toggle__label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; min-width: 0; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.vt-page .lab-toggle__label b { font-weight: 500; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .02em; color: var(--ink); }
.vt-page .lab-toggle__label small { font-weight: 300; font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1.35; color: var(--muted); }
.vt-page .lab-switch { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 54px; height: 28px; border-radius: 999px; background: #ECE8E0; position: relative; transition: background 280ms var(--ease), border-color 280ms var(--ease); border: .5px solid rgba(15, 26, 46, .12); z-index: 1; }
.vt-page .lab-switch:after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 3px; left: 3px; width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15, 26, 46, .22); transition: transform 280ms var(--ease); }
/* v70 · navy literal del mockup; no existe token para este azul en css-variables. */
.vt-page .lab-toggle[aria-pressed="true"] .lab-switch { background: #012169; border-color: #012169; }
.vt-page .lab-toggle[aria-pressed="true"] .lab-switch:after { transform: translateX(26px); }
@keyframes lab-pop { 0% { transform: scale(.95); } 55% { transform: scale(1.035); } 100% { transform: scale(1); } }
@keyframes lab-orbit { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

/* ===================== 4 · WIZARD ===================== */
.vt-page .wizard { width: var(--content); margin: 0 auto; }
.vt-page .wizard-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .92fr 1.08fr; gap: min(5vw, 72px); align-items: stretch; }
.vt-page .wz-preview { position: sticky; top: 120px; align-self: start; border: .5px solid var(--rule); background: #fff; overflow: hidden; }
.vt-page .wz-stage { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 4/5; overflow: hidden; transition: background 600ms var(--ease); }
.vt-page .wz-caption { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; z-index: 3; padding: 20px 22px; background: linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, .94), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0)); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-soft); }
.vt-page .wz-caption b { font-weight: 500; }
.vt-page .wz-progress { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
.vt-page .wz-progress span { flex: 1; height: 2px; background: var(--rule); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
.vt-page .wz-progress span.done:after, .vt-page .wz-progress span.active:after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: var(--ink); transform-origin: left; animation: wzFill 500ms var(--ease) forwards; }
@keyframes wzFill { from { transform: scaleX(0); } to { transform: scaleX(1); } }
.vt-page .wz-panel { position: relative; }
.vt-page .wz-step { display: none; }
.vt-page .wz-step.active { display: block; animation: wzIn 520ms var(--ease-long); }
@keyframes wzIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
.vt-page .wz-q-no { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
.vt-page .wz-step h3 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(26px, 2.6vw, 38px); line-height: 1.1; margin: 12px 0 30px; color: var(--ink); }
.vt-page .wz-options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 14px; }
.vt-page .wz-opt { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; min-height: 64px; padding: 0 22px; border: .5px solid var(--rule); background: #fff; text-align: left; transition: border-color 240ms var(--ease), background 240ms var(--ease), transform 240ms var(--ease); }
.vt-page .wz-opt:hover { border-color: var(--ink); }
.vt-page .wz-opt[aria-pressed="true"] { border-color: var(--ink); background: var(--ink); color: #fff; }
.vt-page .wz-opt .swatch { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; border: .5px solid rgba(15, 26, 46, .25); }
.vt-page .wz-opt[aria-pressed="true"] .swatch { border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .5); }
.vt-page .wz-opt span { font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: .01em; }

/* ===================== 5/6 · RESULTADO ===================== */
.vt-page .result { width: var(--content); margin: 0 auto; }
.vt-page .result-tabs { display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 46px; }
.vt-page .result-tab { min-height: 48px; padding: 0 24px; border: .5px solid var(--rule); background: #fff; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; transition: all 240ms var(--ease); }
.vt-page .result-tab .rank { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 14px; }
.vt-page .result-tab[aria-selected="true"] { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; border-color: var(--ink); }
.vt-page .result-card { display: none; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: min(5vw, 72px); align-items: center; }
.vt-page .result-card.active { display: grid; animation: wzIn 560ms var(--ease-long); }
.vt-page .result-ambient { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 4/5; overflow: hidden; background: var(--stone); }
.vt-page .result-ambient img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 1000ms var(--ease-long); }
.vt-page .result-card:hover .result-ambient img { transform: scale(1.04); }
.vt-page .result-ambient__tag { position: absolute; left: 22px; top: 22px; z-index: 2; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .92); padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink); }
.vt-page .result-body .eyebrow { display: block; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.vt-page .result-body h3 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(30px, 3vw, 46px); line-height: 1.05; margin: 0 0 18px; color: var(--ink); }
.vt-page .result-reason { font-weight: 300; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0 0 30px; max-width: 46ch; }
.vt-page .result-products { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
.vt-page .result-product { text-align: center; }
.vt-page .result-product__img { aspect-ratio: 1/1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: var(--paper-warm); padding: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.vt-page .result-product__img img { max-height: 100%; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; transition: transform 600ms var(--ease); }
.vt-page .result-product:hover .result-product__img img { transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.04); }
.vt-page .result-product b { display: block; font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 3px; }
.vt-page .result-product small { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .06em; color: var(--ink-soft); }
.vt-page .result-ctas { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; }

/* ===================== 7 · COMPRA POR CAPAS ===================== */
.vt-page .layers-buy { width: var(--content); margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
.vt-page .buy-card { border: .5px solid var(--rule); padding: 40px 34px 36px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: #fff; transition: border-color 280ms var(--ease), transform 280ms var(--ease), box-shadow 280ms var(--ease); }
.vt-page .buy-card:hover { border-color: var(--ink); transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 24px 50px rgba(15, 26, 46, .07); }
.vt-page .buy-card.feature { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; border-color: var(--ink); }
.vt-page .buy-card__tier { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .24em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
.vt-page .buy-card.feature .buy-card__tier { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .7); }
.vt-page .buy-card h3 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.1; margin: 14px 0 6px; }
.vt-page .buy-card__price { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 20px; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 22px; }
.vt-page .buy-card.feature .buy-card__price { color: #fff; }
.vt-page .buy-card ul { list-style: none; margin: 0 0 30px; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 13px; flex: 1; }
.vt-page .buy-card li { position: relative; padding-left: 24px; font-weight: 300; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--ink-soft); }
.vt-page .buy-card.feature li { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .86); }
.vt-page .buy-card li:before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 8px; width: 11px; height: .5px; background: currentColor; opacity: .6; }
.vt-page .buy-card .ghost-btn { width: 100%; }
.vt-page .buy-card.feature .ghost-btn { border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .8); color: #fff; }
.vt-page .buy-card.feature .ghost-btn:hover { background: #fff; color: var(--ink); }

/* ===================== Cart toast ===================== */
.vt-page .vt-toast { position: fixed; left: 50%; bottom: 28px; transform: translate(-50%, 30px); z-index: 120; background: var(--ink); color: #fff; padding: 16px 26px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity 300ms var(--ease), transform 300ms var(--ease); }
.vt-page .vt-toast.show { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, 0); }

/* ===================== RESPONSIVE ===================== */
@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .vt-page { --content: min(92vw, 1760px); }
  .vt-page .lab, .vt-page .wizard-grid, .vt-page .result-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .vt-page .lab { gap: 48px; }
  .vt-page .wz-preview { position: relative; top: 0; order: -1; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .vt-page .wz-stage { aspect-ratio: 16/10; }
